	)

	(text "Pool: 74HCT541 isolates/redrives the shared DATA[7:0] byte bus as IN_DATA[7:0]; the pool compares one byte per access.\nArgmax: four 74HCT574 latches hold bytes 0..3 of a little-endian score word; 74HC238 decodes SCORE_ADDR[1:0] into the four latch clocks while MEM_ACK is high (S02 data-valid capture).\nS12 is a width/staging bridge; S06 generates the byte address and S04/S02 execute one REQ/ACK transaction per byte."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 23 0)
		(effects
			(font
